                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="KjgFcBiX4fa2GWNaSQUY-17" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1. &lt;/b&gt;Javascript code is directly connecting to v8 because it parses and compiles the js code into machine code&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;using JIT compilation and also to manage the call stack&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. &lt;/b&gt;We have some fantastic core APIs (&lt;u&gt;like fs, http, path, streams, buffers etc&lt;/u&gt;) but some of&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; them are written in JS so they cant diectly interact with the OS.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. &lt;/b&gt;So we have a mediator which is c++ bindings which connects our &lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;JS facing Node APIs to&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &amp;quot;Comic Sans MS&amp;quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;native functionalities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;Libuv equips Node with event loop, thread pool and async operation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot; face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt; And lastly operating system is going to do low level tasks like reading and writting the file,&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; tracking time etc&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
